        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/apple-store-austin-john-ternus-deidre-duo-launch.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has rolled out its holiday theming at the online Apple Store, and with it a new, extended return policy has just been put into place. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-stores\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077722\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/apple-store-now-offers-extended-holiday-returns-for-all-products-2026/#more-1077722\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
