        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/twelve-south-retractable-usb-c-charger/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/Twelve-South-Cablesnap-Retractable-USB-C-Travel-Charger-2026.jpg.webp?w=1500\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Popular Apple accessory maker Twelve South is launching a new retractable Cablesnap 65W travel charger this week. It has a built-in USB-C cable, alongside an additional USB-C port and USB-A port.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can order the new Cablesnap 65W on <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0itWMW5o\">Amazon today for $49.99</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"twelve-south\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077713\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/twelve-south-retractable-usb-c-charger/#more-1077713\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
