        "title": "MacBook Pro with PROLED review, new iPad mini hands-on, and iOS 27.3 features",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/happy-hour-615/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2018/04/9to5mac-happy-hour-lead1.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It’s another bumper week, with Chance’s hands-on reviews of both the new iPad mini and the new MacBook Pro to discuss, especially around just how good the OLED display looks, and how touchscreens fit into the Mac ecosystem. Also, iOS 27.3 is packed with a bunch of new features, including updates to Safari, Siri AI, StandBy and more, and the new audio recap features are now testable on Apple Watch.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">And in Happy Hour Plus, we talk about John Ternus’s first time hosting Apple’s quarterly earnings call. Subscribe at <a href=\"http://9to5mac.com/join\">9to5mac.com/join</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://protonvpn.com/happyhour\">Sponsored by Proton VPN</a>: Keep your online activity private and secure. Get 75% off a two-year plan at <a href=\"https://protonvpn.com/happyhour\">protonvpn.com/happyhour</a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://square.com/go/happyhour\">Sponsored by Square</a>: Get up to $200 off Square hardware when you sign up at <a href=\"https://square.com/go/happyhour\">square.com/go/happyhour</a>. #squarepod</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://gusto.com/happyhour\">Sponsored by Gusto</a>: Payroll, benefits, and HR all in one place. Get three months free when you run your first payroll at <a href=\"https://gusto.com/happyhour\">gusto.com/happyhour</a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://click.cash.app/ui6m/i4d1b1x2\">Sponsored by Cash App</a>: Download Cash App today. Click here to get started: <a href=\"https://click.cash.app/ui6m/i4d1b1x2\">https://click.cash.app/ui6m/i4d1b1x2</a> #CashAppPartner. Bitcoin services by Block, Inc. See the Bitcoin disclosures at <a href=\"https://cash.app/legal/podcast\">cash.app/legal/podcast</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pfx.vpixl.com/sla7w/mgln.ai/e/802/pscrb.fm/rss/p/9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/HH-615.mp3\"></audio></figure>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5mac-happy-hour,podcast\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077655\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/happy-hour-615/#more-1077655\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
