        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/04/report-apple-reduces-employees-ai-token-allowances-as-ternus-moves-to-cut-costs/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/john-ternus-imac-launch.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-04/apple-cuts-internal-ai-usage-budgets-in-move-to-reduce-spending\"><em>Bloomberg</em></a> reports that Apple has begun reducing employees’ daily AI spending limits, with some engineers seeing their allowances cut from $300 to $200, and further reductions planned across multiple teams. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077472\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/04/report-apple-reduces-employees-ai-token-allowances-as-ternus-moves-to-cut-costs/#more-1077472\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
