        "title": "Apple’s DOJ antitrust battle sparks disputes with Epic, Samsung, Oura, Roblox, more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/apples-doj-antitrust-battle-sparks-disputes-with-epic-samsung-oura-roblox-more/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2023/10/apple-park-dusk.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Several tech companies are pushing back against subpoenas issued by Apple and the DOJ in their ongoing antitrust battle. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077775\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/apples-doj-antitrust-battle-sparks-disputes-with-epic-samsung-oura-roblox-more/#more-1077775\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
