        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/deals-macbook-air-apple-watch-ultra-homeview-airpods/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/Apple-deals-early-Black-Friday-Ultra-MacBook-HomeView-HomePod.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Firstly, go secure yourself a couple <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0afh2oP2\">2026 Apple Polishing Cloths at $9 a pop</a> before they sell out, a well as the <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0e2V3cYa\">Apple HomeView pre-order discount</a>, then scope out the <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0byNaKIa\">AirPods Pro 3 at $50 off</a> and all five colors of <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B027JcjjP\">Apple’s AirPods Max 2 at <strong>$100 off</strong></a><strong>.</strong> We also still have various <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B052sQ1vK\">Apple Watch Ultra 4 models at nearly <strong>$100 off</strong></a> to match the all-time low and a return of clearance pricing on the <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0bv63Q7g\">Ultra 3 at <strong>$250 off</strong></a> the original list. Today’s headliner deal though would have to be these <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B03TXVRVD\">M5 MacBook Air models</a> that dropped in price again to lowest price we have tracked in nearly 5 months at <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B03TXVRVD\"><strong>$250 off</strong></a> the list. Those offers join a chance to save some cash on the new <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/06/apple-homepod-mini-2-deals/\">HomePod mini 2</a>, rare deals on some of the <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/06/shure-dynamic-microphone-deals/\">best podcasting mics</a> in the game, and the official start of <a href=\"https://bestbuycreators.7tiv.net/xL1Q9y\">Best Buy’s massive early Black Friday sale</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5toys,9to5toys-lunch-break,deals\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077741\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/deals-macbook-air-apple-watch-ultra-homeview-airpods/#more-1077741\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
