        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/report-apple-faces-congressional-scrutiny-over-ice-tracking-apps-and-trump-donations/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/08/cook-gift-glass.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/democratic-senator-demands-tech-firms-fcc-chair-turn-over-documents-2026-11-05/\"><em>Reuters</em></a> and <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/technology/2026/11/06/after-courting-trump-corporate-america-faces-democratic-reckoning/\"><em>The Washington Post</em></a> report that Apple is among the tech giants potentially facing congressional investigations as Democrats prepare to take control of both chambers in January. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077795\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/06/report-apple-faces-congressional-scrutiny-over-ice-tracking-apps-and-trump-donations/#more-1077795\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
