        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-18-pro-glacier-apple-watch-airpods-5.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">According to a new report from <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/counterpoint-research/\">Counterpoint Research</a>, Apple just recorded its highest-ever global smartphone revenue for a third calendar quarter. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,counterpoint-research,iphone\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077687\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/05/report-apple-captured-half-of-global-smartphone-revenue-in-q3/#more-1077687\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
