        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/04/deals-homeview-apple-watch-ultra-macbook-neo/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/Apple-deals-HomeView-Apple-Watch-Ultra-MacBook-Neo.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0e2V3cYa\">Apple HomeView pre-order discount</a> is back and the deal <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0byNaKIa\">AirPods Pro 3 at $50 off</a> is still flying, but we are also tracking return all-time lows on <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0fW5eJAd\">Apple Watch Ultra 4 at nearly $100 off</a> and today we spotted a series of major clearance deals on Apple <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B06DtiAJ7\">Watch Ultra 3 at <strong>$250 off</strong></a>. We also have a rare discount on the most affordable <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B07q88uoa\">Silver MacBook Neo</a> (and up to <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/04/rare-deal-apples-most-affordable-macbook-neo/\"><strong>$120 off</strong></a> models from the Apple refurb store), all-time lows on Apple’s new <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B00UwWNyJ\">iPhone/AirPods Wrist Strap</a>, the latest 10-foot <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/04/beats-usb-c-braided-cable-deals/\">Beats 240W USB-C Braided Cable</a> in all four colors <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/04/beats-usb-c-braided-cable-deals/\">at just $18</a>, and much more waiting below. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Update:</strong> The <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0eiIrgnL\">2026 Apple Polishing Cloth</a> is now <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0eiIrgnL\">back in-stock at <strong>$9 Prime shipped</strong></a>. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5toys,9to5toys-lunch-break\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077423\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/04/deals-homeview-apple-watch-ultra-macbook-neo/#more-1077423\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
