        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/03/apple-watch-challenge-set-for-veterans-day/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2023/10/apple-watch-veteran-challenge.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The next <a href=\"https://link.amazon/A05PZ3psH\">Apple Watch</a> fitness challenge is set for Veterans Day on Wednesday, November 11th, 2026. Apple Watch Challenges increase awareness about fitness features and healthy habits while observing holidays and other notable occasions.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-health,apple-watch\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077303\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/03/apple-watch-challenge-set-for-veterans-day/#more-1077303\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
