        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-adds-all-new-apple-health-app-details-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/health-app-ios-27-2-watchos-27-2.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/03/apple-releases-first-ios-27-3-developer-beta-for-iphone/\">released</a> iOS 27.3 beta 1 today, and it reintroduces the all-new Health app that was first available for testing during the iOS 27.2 beta. Here’s what’s new.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-health,ios-27,ios-27-3\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1077252\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-adds-all-new-apple-health-app-details-here/#more-1077252\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
