        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/03/apple-announces-fitness-gym-strength-program-with-personalized-workout-plans/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/fitness-stregnth-training.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple wants to help you get stronger. Apple Fitness+ is expanding to the gym with a new strength training experience. Gym Strength is now available in beta, bringing personalized workout plans, exercise demonstrations, and <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0bzALPZx\">Apple Watch</a> logging to your lifting routine.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-fitness,apple-health,apple-watch\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1076390\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/11/03/apple-announces-fitness-gym-strength-program-with-personalized-workout-plans/#more-1076390\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
